:te
foo as (Top -> Top -> Bot)
//│ ═══[TYPE ERROR] Cannot solve judgment ∀α, β, γ. α → β → ({β ≤ (Int ⟹ {γ ≥ Int, α ≤ Int}) ∨ (Str ⟹ {γ ≥ Str, α ≤ Str}), α ≤ (Int ⟹ {γ ≥ Int, β ≤ Int}) ∨ (Str ⟹ {γ ≥ Str, β ≤ Str}), γ ≥ (Int ⟹ {β ≤ Int, α ≤ Int}) ∧ (Str ⟹ {β ≤ Str, α ≤ Str})} ⟹ γ) ≤ ⊤ → ⊤ → ⊥.
